== Attributes and Skills ==
<pvxbig>
[build prof=A/D sha=12+1+3 crit=8 scy=9 wind=5 deadly=2][Deadly Paradox][Shadow Form][Shroud of Distress][Crippling Victory][Reap Impurities][Grenth's Aura][Optional][Critical Agility][/build]
;Optional slot
* {{skill pvxicon|"I Am Unstoppable!"}} when learning the farm. The warriors can only KD you while you are running. 
* {{skill pvxicon|"Finish Him!"}} speeds up the kill a lot. Only for when you are confident that you won't get knocked on important moments (just before SF runs out), try some runs with {{skill pvxicon|"I Am Unstoppable!"}} first.
</pvxbig>
== Equipment ==
;Armor
* Insignia: [[gww:Blessed Insignia|Blessed Insignias]] 
** Any insignia works, but armor insignias are the safest. [[gww:Blessed Insignia|Blessed Insignias]] is the least conditional.
* Runes: Appropriate attribute runes, best [[gww:Rune of Vigor|Vigor]] you can afford, [[gww:Rune of Attunement|Attunement]]
** Armor piece with Rune of Critical Strikes should be used if you have it, but it's optional
;Weapons
* (Customized) [[gww:Zealous|Zealous]] Scythe [[gww:Of_Enchanting|Of Enchanting]], ideally with [[gww:Inscription#Guided_by_Fate|"Guided by Fate"]] (15^50 also works)

== Usage ==
<pvxbig>
* Grab a 7 hero team, preferably with a speed boost (to speed up the running)
* Flag your heroes at the res shrine (so they don't leech loot)
* Pull the group of Afflicted near the stairs, to the shrine
* Optionally, micro the speedboost to speed up your running
* Run towards the stairs 
* Before you aggro the group, use {{skill pvxicon|Deadly Paradox|2}}, then cast {{skill pvxicon|Shroud of Distress|16}} and {{skill pvxicon|Shadow Form|16}}
* Try to pull the caster mobs into a ball ([https://youtu.be/KBRa6K4PPbg?t=41 see video])
** While cast IAU when there are warrior on you, to avoid getting KD while moving
** Cast {{skill pvxicon|Grenth's Aura|5}} if your hp gets low
* When the casters are nicely balled, run up to the boss and ball the melees aswel. Might need some repositioning.
* Cast {{skill pvxicon|Critical Agility}}
* Kill the group with {{skill pvxicon|Crippling Victory|9}} followed by {{skill pvxicon|Reap Impurities|9}}. Cast {{skill pvxicon|Grenth's Aura|5}} whenever you have enough energy available to keep up your defensive enchantments
** Keep {{skill pvxicon|Shadow Form|16}}, {{skill pvxicon|Shroud of Distress|16}} and {{skill pvxicon|Critical Agility}} active. Remember to use {{skill pvxicon|Deadly Paradox|2}} before {{skill pvxicon|Shadow Form|16}}
</pvxbig>
== Counters ==
<pvxbig>
* [[gww:Afflicted_Ranger|Afflicted Rangers]]
** They have {{skill pvxicon|Throw Dirt}} and {{skill pvxicon|Broad Head Arrow}}, which is really annoying to deal with. Better to just resign and go again when you notice there is one in the group
* Not keeping up your enchantments
</pvxbig>

